<title>USA: Rayonier ups dividend, expands share buyback.</title>
<headline>Rayonier ups dividend, expands share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rayonier Inc said on Friday its board increased the quarterly dividend to $0.30 per share from $0.29, and expanded the company's share repurchase program for 1997 to $50 million, from $17 million.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on March 31 to stockholders of record on March 10, it said. The dividend is the third increase since it became public in 1994, it said.</p>
<p>The 1997 share repurchase includes an ongoing program set last year to minimize the dilutive effect on earnings per share of the company's employee incentive stock plans. Under that program in 1996, 437,800 shares were repurchased for $16.5 million.</p>
</text>
